  abilityDesc: 18 combo powerful Fire attack on all foes (damage relative to remaining
    HP), hugely boosts damage against status afflicted foes for 3 turns, probable
    critical and elemental vulnerability infliction for 1 turn, probable huge 1 turn
    Atk, Def reduction, boosts own Atk, Def, Rec for 3 turns & hugely boosts own
    critical hit rate for 3 turns
